{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ccde41231cc4168c58e24a1036d801801990a75fbe1b3fe53b9aabc4958557c0", "ja": "（今日は、アイスのCM撮影だ。休憩のあとは、\n妖精役のやよいが、スプーンに乗るシーンだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍冰淇淋广告。休息结束后，饰演妖精的弥生要拍乘在勺子上的场景，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "06295d148b47a7e81fbc0216dabcfad0b1f8415e69e480b725f9401b42bc300a", "ja": "{$P$}、すごいんです！　\n私が乗るスプーン、すっごく大きいんですよっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，不得了！  \n要让我坐上去的勺子，特别特别大呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "915f39c4bad7851936fd832db31f45b1b769119c73113401a7fc24a7f35e3621", "ja": "はは、そうだな。実際のCMだと、スプーンは普通で\n乗ってるやよいが小さく見えるんだろうけど。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。实际的广告里，勺子应该是普通大小，而坐在上面的弥生看起来会很小吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "7031e805ace99b5c16e0c2365eab8cf7415f0805caf9d25d51e82ecfab9e87b7", "ja": "えっと……このあと私、アイスと一緒にあのスプーンに\nすくわれて、食べられそうになっちゃうんですよね？", "zh": "那个……接下来，我好像要和冰淇淋一起被那把勺子舀起来，然后被吃掉，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f47beb940659140191333a161d4e2a7af10603ef7a1f72da7a4399a7ebdf5f36", "ja": "ああ、そういう設定のCMだって聞いてるけど、\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，我听说是设定成那样的广告，不过你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "ccfd5b620d3b1fe1a13388d0a32423564f38fc6e672d873862191383c8813340", "ja": "はい。私、アイス食べるのは好きですけど、\n食べられるのは初めてだから……。", "zh": "是的。我虽然喜欢吃冰淇淋，但还是第一次被人吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "2729be06469f04badec2f1e65918bde07a240825b24caf7677476288524a61d9", "ja": "私、ちゃんとおいしそうに見えるのかなーって……。", "zh": "我……真的看起来很好吃的样子吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cf100972ba56cd3a8d1f239885dcabbf158e23192b3db3d3928a4315e6fd008c", "ja": "なんだ、そんなこと心配してたのか。\nおいしさは気にしなくていいよ。", "zh": "原来你是在担心这种事啊。\n不用在意看起来好不好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "cd581befece711af938d22fefe8ff908665fd18740c1568ae4e62e5daa38613f", "ja": "ダメです～。アイスのCMのお仕事だから、たくさん\n買ってもらえるように、おいしそうでないと～。", "zh": "不行啦～。因为是冰淇淋广告的工作，所以得看起来很好吃，这样才能让大家多买一些～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "8ac50b9d355fe3464b709c346a40fa067dac57bd4ce1ccef1411098a401d66f4", "ja": "でも私、体もまだちっちゃいし、髪の毛も多いし……。\nうう、どうしたらいいんでしょう～！", "zh": "可是我的身体还小，头发也很多……  \n呜呜，我该怎么办才好呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1010_p", "source_sha256": "786e096960171d5d53879b144bee3b336bdec778bcc94938e902ee9f3aa150b7", "ja": "まあまあ、大丈夫だよ。\n……そういえば、やよい。ここまでの撮影は順調か？", "zh": "好啦好啦，没事的。\n……对了，弥生，到目前为止拍摄还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "00c3b2bcbc82b235fd67ff04a17680aa8b4b4eb8609c58535f8297ab9202092e", "ja": "え？　あ、はい！　すごいんですっ。スプーンのほかに\nも、アイスもフルーツも大きいのがたくさんあって。", "zh": "咦？啊，好的！特别棒！除了勺子以外，还有好多大块的冰淇淋和水果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "3a7e802098281dc2d7b116d156ad2d8085bcd78b2a2ab3ec0c085574876b8f10", "ja": "セットがみーんなキラキラしてて、カラフルで、\nすっごくカワイイです～♪", "zh": "整套餐具都闪闪发光的，五颜六色，而且特别可爱～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "db5dce35e63329d117558e3b492eac9b21156ff306b1007082da96884ac4f962", "ja": "そうかそうか。『食べちゃいたいくらいかわいい』\nって感じかな？", "zh": "这样啊，这样啊。就是“可爱到让人想吃掉”的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "81dd38ee4af59c9f9e1e06c10a72ba117b9c890a842e28fbae0ac24e835e9327", "ja": "はいっ、そんな感じです！\nカワイくて甘そうで、みーんな美味しそうかも！", "zh": "是的是的，就是这种感觉！\n又可爱又甜滋滋的，感觉大家都很好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1d4793c4d3db3158e015b317e268023db467b55890456ba015dce1260520264a", "ja": "そうだよな。だからやよいも、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "是啊。所以弥生也没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "cdf2c1bd2f8b993cef2f07cf83153bc4bc4798aa8c441014ce9575e6b23f94c7", "ja": "はい、私……えっ？", "zh": "好的，我……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "502d9ab154c547168054e08872b422cff88ffc0995f4fcb023908153a3508784", "ja": "やよいのいつもの笑顔で、かわいくしていてくれれば\n大丈夫。みんなちゃんと食べたくなるから。", "zh": "只要保持弥生平时那种可爱的笑容就\n没问题了。大家肯定都会想好好吃下去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "41cc6428e652e1e7745aa1f7dae46f7fa79fa69b8dae79b168d6f21b50b85a59", "ja": "そっか……。えへへっ、ありがとうございます～。\nそう思ってもらえるように、がんばらないとですねっ。", "zh": "这样啊……嘿嘿，谢谢您～。\n为了能让大家这么想，我也得努力才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fe3d95cf8eed8b4ab7cf27bcf6812f315ba81b61b169627894814ac2bfbadb3f", "ja": "うん、そのちょっと照れた感じもカワイイぞ！\nこのあとの撮影、期待しているからな。", "zh": "嗯，有点害羞的样子也很可爱哦！\n接下来的拍摄，我很期待你的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0174_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "e71f4a6a3ee73fea91162b76f138420cb933580646215594685a288e9be0ac88", "ja": "はい！　私、おなかいっぱい食べたくなるくらい、\nかわいい妖精になりきってみせますね！　いぇい♪", "zh": "好的！我会彻底融入可爱的精灵角色，努力到让人都想吃得饱饱的程度！耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
